<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 37,011 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 37,011 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 37,011 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Thursday compared to 76,028 tonnes in the same period on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Thursday    Jan 15</p>
<p>    Export cargo		14,532	11,768</p>
<p>    Import cargo		22,479	64,260</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, eight ships sailed and five berthed. In the next 24 hours, four are expected to sail and 13 are expected to arrive.  </p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Karachi Port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	  Tonnes/TEUs  Ship		   Berthing</p>
<p>Fertiliser	     25,210	 Iktinos	     17/1</p>
<p>Soyoil		   13,000	 Cislo-De-Milano   18/1</p>
<p>Vehicles		    100	 Hual Favorite     20/1</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
